            </profile>
            <profile id="7224-377e-1424-e0cb" name="Equipment and options (as printed in AoA2)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Auxiliaries and light cohorts have a hand weapon, throwing spear or thrusting spear and shield. May have light armour (+2) and may be Drilled (+2) and Veteran (+1). One unit of auxiliaries may be upgraded to Elite (Ld 8, +1). Light Cohorts are Light Infantry.

Archers have a hand weapon, composite bow and buckler. Light Infantry. May have light armour (+2) and be Drilled (+2) and Veteran (+1). One unit may be upgraded to Elite (Ld8, +1).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="b804-b62d-520c-a446" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">5+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
